Original commit body from 4ca849d:

The tree structure now ensures directory diversity by including one
representative file from each root-level directory (up to max_root_dirs),
rather than taking only the top 5 files by centrality.

Previously, directories containing only lower-ranked files would be
hidden under "[and N other items]" even when the max_root_dirs limit
wasn't reached. Now each root directory gets its highest-centrality
file as representative.
